WEBVTT

59:02.572 --> 59:05.824
I mean, I mean, what chance
does a toy like me have

59:05.909 --> 59:09.203
against a Buzz Lightyear
action figure?

59:09.287 --> 59:11.872
All I can do is...

59:11.956 --> 59:16.376
There's a snake in my boots.

59:16.461 --> 59:18.754
Why would Andy ever want
to play with me

59:18.838 --> 59:21.548
when he's got you?

59:22.342 --> 59:26.011
I'm the one that should be
strapped to that rocket.
